; Quotes and estimates received for copies, searches and records (memorandum ledger). Nothing here was paid.
; Kept apart from the cash accounts in main.beancount and never added to them. Each entry is a fee or paid-copy offer a body made
; in reply to a request (kind "quoted"), or our own estimate of a published fee (kind "estimate"). The amount is the headline figure
; as quoted (one unit: first image, one hour, one search, shortest band, one document; the RICS line is its own all-volumes figure).
; Offers with no figure are flagged ! and carry 0.00. price_text keeps the full price as written; vat records how VAT was stated.
; Added 10 Nov 2026. free: whether the free FOI/EIR allowance (or a free route) came before the fee: yes / no / na (not FOI, a copy or statutory fee) / nc (not checked); free_basis and free_url give the legal basis.
